          "Permafrost lies under almost all of the land; buildings stand on piles (stilts) driven into it.",
          "The Svalbard Global Seed Vault (opened 2008) stores over a million crop seed samples deep in the frozen mountainside.",
          "Svalbard is warming several times faster than the global average, causing permafrost thaw and landslides.",
